      <description>Medical appointments, hospital visits, and clinical consultations</description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2 id="clinical-encounters">Clinical Encounters</h2>
<p>This section contains detailed records of all medical appointments, hospital visits, and clinical consultations.</p>
<h3 id="subsections">Subsections</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Oncology Visits</strong> — Regular cancer treatment appointments</li>
<li><strong>Hospital Admissions</strong> — Inpatient encounters</li>
<li><strong>Specialist Consultations</strong> — Specialist evaluations and recommendations</li>
<li><strong>Imaging Studies</strong> — Procedures for diagnostic imaging</li>
<li><strong>Procedures</strong> — Medical and surgical procedures</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="organization">Organization</h3>
<p>Encounters are organized chronologically. Each encounter includes:</p>
<ul>
<li>Date and time</li>
<li>Facility and provider</li>
<li>Chief complaint or reason for visit</li>
<li>Vital signs</li>
<li>Assessment and plan</li>
<li>Follow-up recommendations</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<p>Individual encounter records are available in the subdirectories.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
      
      
